# Prisma and infrastructure

Read [`docs/adr/0002-prisma-behind-repositories.md`](../../docs/adr/0002-prisma-behind-repositories.md).
The schema in `prisma/schema.prisma` is the database contract.

- Never import `@prisma/client` types outside `src/infrastructure`.
- New persistence belongs behind repository ports. Do not add Prisma calls in
  controllers.
- Seed and migrations stay under `prisma/`.
